      "content": "ok i just took the two pills. my skin is still really itchy but the tightness in my throat is definitely getting more intense now. i'm starting to feel a bit dizzy too. should i try taking another dose of benadryl or maybe some tylenol to help with the discomfort? i'm trying to wait for the first dose to kick in before i panic.",
